    "difficultyReason": "Underline equal-priority operations and evaluate, where the left-to-right rule across multiply and divide chains is the hardest item but still one rule applied to three operations."
  },
  "content": {
    "id": "p54-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Underline all the operations that have equal priority, then calculate the answer.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$4\\times(-2)+3\\times5$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\underline{4\\times(-2)}+\\underline{3\\times5}$; $7$.",
          "worked": "Underline the two multiplications.\n$$\\begin{align*}4\\times(-2)+3\\times5&=-8+3\\times5\\\\&=-8+15\\\\&=7\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$4\\times(-2)+3\\times(-5)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\underline{4\\times(-2)}+\\underline{3\\times(-5)}$; $-23$.",
          "worked": "Underline the two multiplications.\n$$\\begin{align*}4\\times(-2)+3\\times(-5)&=-8+3\\times(-5)\\\\&=-8+(-15)\\\\&=-23\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$4\\times(-2)-3\\times5$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\underline{4\\times(-2)}-\\underline{3\\times5}$; $-23$.",
          "worked": "Underline the two multiplications.\n$$\\begin{align*}4\\times(-2)-3\\times5&=-8-3\\times5\\\\&=-8-15\\\\&=-23\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$(2-10)\\div(9-7)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(\\underline{2-10})\\div(\\underline{9-7})$; $-4$.",
          "worked": "Underline the subtractions inside the two brackets.\n$$\\begin{align*}(2-10)\\div(9-7)&=(-8)\\div(9-7)\\\\&=(-8)\\div2\\\\&=-4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$(2-10)\\div(7-9)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(\\underline{2-10})\\div(\\underline{7-9})$; $4$.",
          "worked": "Underline the subtractions inside the two brackets.\n$$\\begin{align*}(2-10)\\div(7-9)&=(-8)\\div(7-9)\\\\&=(-8)\\div(-2)\\\\&=4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$3-4\\times(-6)\\div2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3-\\underline{4\\times(-6)\\div2}$; $15$. Multiply and divide from left to right.",
          "worked": "Underline the multiplication and division; they have equal priority. Work from left to right.\n$$\\begin{align*}3-4\\times(-6)\\div2&=3-(-24)\\div2\\\\&=3-(-12)\\\\&=3+12\\\\&=15\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$3+4\\times(-6)\\div2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3+\\underline{4\\times(-6)\\div2}$; $-9$. Multiply and divide from left to right.",
          "worked": "Underline the multiplication and division; they have equal priority. Work from left to right.\n$$\\begin{align*}3+4\\times(-6)\\div2&=3+(-24)\\div2\\\\&=3+(-12)\\\\&=3-12\\\\&=-9\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$3-4\\times(-6)\\div2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3-\\underline{4\\times(-6)\\div2}$; $15$. Multiply and divide from left to right.",
          "worked": "Underline the multiplication and division; they have equal priority. Work from left to right.\n$$\\begin{align*}3-4\\times(-6)\\div2&=3-(-24)\\div2\\\\&=3-(-12)\\\\&=3+12\\\\&=15\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p54-q5-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$3+4\\times(-6)\\div(-2)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3+\\underline{4\\times(-6)\\div(-2)}$; $15$. Multiply and divide from left to right.",
          "worked": "Underline the multiplication and division; they have equal priority. Work from left to right.\n$$\\begin{align*}3+4\\times(-6)\\div(-2)&=3+(-24)\\div(-2)\\\\&=3+12\\\\&=15\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      }
    ]
